<title>THAILAND: Nava Finance 1996 net profit higher.</title>
<headline>Nava Finance 1996 net profit higher.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited unconsolidated financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>			   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		4.17	vs	     4.90</p>
<p>    Net		     938.96	vs	   868.52</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Nava Finance and Securities Plc, a finance and securities firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
